              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To log into your Microsoft OneDrive account, you can use the web browser, your computer, or a mobile device. \n\n### 1. Log in via Web Browser (Any Device)\nThe quickest way to access your files from any computer or tablet is through your browser:\n1. Go to the official **[OneDrive Login Page](https://onedrive.live.com)**.\n2. Click **Sign in** (usually in the top right corner or center of the page).\n3. Enter your Microsoft account email, phone number, or Skype ID, then click **Next**.\n4. Enter your password and click **Sign in**. \n\n*Note: If you are using a work or school account, you can also sign in through the **[Microsoft 365 Portal](https://login.microsoftonline.com)**.*\n\n---\n\n### 2. Log in on Windows\nOneDrive is built into Windows 10 and Windows 11:\n1. Press the **Windows Key** on your keyboard and type **OneDrive** in the search bar.\n2. Click on the **OneDrive app** from the search results to open it.\n3. If you aren't signed in, a setup window will appear. Enter your Microsoft account email and click **Sign in**.\n4. Follow the brief on-screen instructions to choose your folder location and sync your files. You can access your files anytime by opening **File Explorer** and clicking **OneDrive** in the left-hand sidebar.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Log in on Mac\n1. Open the **App Store** on your Mac and search for **Microsoft OneDrive** to download it if you haven't already.\n2. Launch the **OneDrive** app from your Applications folder or Launchpad.\n3. Enter your Microsoft account email and password to log in.\n4. Follow the setup steps. Once completed, your OneDrive folder will appear in your **Finder** sidebar.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Log in on Mobile (iOS & Android)\nIf you want to view, back up, or share photos and documents on the go:\n* **For iPhone/iPad:** Download the **[OneDrive App from the Apple App Store](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/microsoft-onedrive/id823766854)**.\n* **For Android:** Download the **[OneDrive App from the Google Play Store](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.microsoft.skydrive&hl=en)**.\n* Once downloaded, open the app, enter your Microsoft credentials, and tap **Sign in**.",
